.TH OPENGONSULT 1 "August 2026" "OpenGonsult 0.88" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
opengonsult \- Nissan CONSULT-I diagnostic suite for Linux (GTK4)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opengonsult
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B OpenGonsult
is an open-source diagnostic tool for Nissan vehicles equipped with the
CONSULT-I (14-pin) diagnostic interface. It provides a native GTK4
interface with a left navigation panel containing five pages: live
Dashboard with circular visual gauges, Graphing with selectable sensor
sources, Diagnostics for diagnostic trouble codes, Settings for serial
device and theme configuration, and About.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the application version and exit.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Settings are persisted to
.IR ~/.config/opengonsult/config.json
(dark mode, serial device, baud rate, simulation mode).
.SH SEE ALSO
GTK4 documentation, CONSULT-I protocol references.
.SH AUTHOR
OpenGonsult Maintainers <OpenConsult@users.noreply.github.com>
